The following patch applies to NH 3.1.1;

Nice changes made:
	o auto gold pickup option
	o kill list at end of game
	o destroy scroll/potion/wand extended command
	o spells of healing/extra healing have directions

This is an unoffical patch, however I have sent this to the DEV team so
it might just end up in 3.1.2!?

Note I didnt write the kill list; I just like it!

Enjoy!

